From 52b57ffe46f9f54087f75d684798b54b44b5d8a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aphrody-dev <contact@aphrody.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:25:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Read nodes through kitesurf's packed-storage accessors

kitesurf's blitz-dom series packs node storage: parent, children, layout children, inline layouts and
list markers move behind accessors (parent_id, children, layout_children, inline_layout_data, ...).
---
